    "detailed_description": "<h1>Farmer Wars</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Waterfowl hunting (also known as wildfowling) is the practice of hunting ducks, geese, or other waterfowl for food and sport.<br>Ok, that's enough snooty refinement. Now it's just you, your guns, your confident canine companion, and the great outdoors! In Duck Flighting (sic) you get to relive the iconic arcade experience of Duck Hunt in a brand new package.<br><br><strong>But wait!</strong><br>There's more.<br>\u2013 Many types of guns! Some, uh, better suited for hunting than others, but that just makes your feats all the more impressive, right? <br>\u2013 Hunt ducks and geese.<br>\u2013 The birds become faster every round. <br>\u2013 And don't forget your companion. We know \u2013 it's a German shepherd and they're not ideal for the job, but that's just the model we happened to have lying around.<br>\u2013 Where are your hunting grounds? Even we're not sure, and we honestly don't care either \u2013 they're lovely enough and the game is FUN.<br><br><strong>So come on!</strong><br>Give it a shot...",
    "about_the_game": "Waterfowl hunting (also known as wildfowling) is the practice of hunting ducks, geese, or other waterfowl for food and sport.<br>Ok, that's enough snooty refinement. Now it's just you, your guns, your confident canine companion, and the great outdoors! In Duck Flighting (sic) you get to relive the iconic arcade experience of Duck Hunt in a brand new package.<br><br><strong>But wait!</strong><br>There's more.<br>\u2013 Many types of guns! Some, uh, better suited for hunting than others, but that just makes your feats all the more impressive, right? <br>\u2013 Hunt ducks and geese.<br>\u2013 The birds become faster every round. <br>\u2013 And don't forget your companion. We know \u2013 it's a German shepherd and they're not ideal for the job, but that's just the model we happened to have lying around.<br>\u2013 Where are your hunting grounds? Even we're not sure, and we honestly don't care either \u2013 they're lovely enough and the game is FUN.<br><br><strong>So come on!</strong><br>Give it a shot...",
    "short_description": "Duck Flighting may just be the ultimate experience in duck hunting simulation! And if it's not ultimate, we definitely guarantee it's an experience of some sort! With guns to fire, ducks to hunt, and a gorgeous nature scene to enjoy, we wish you all a fun time with our little project.",
